# The working tree is LF regardless of the machine's core.autocrlf.
#
# Every file here is committed SOURCE, served verbatim to the browser: the Host
# reads `src/client.js` and hands it to the page unmodified
# (dsh-client-modules/lib/index.js:701-731). CRLF would not break that at
# runtime, but every diff against a Linux check would show whole files as
# changed, which is exactly the noise that hides a real change.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary